menu "CampusPulse optional profiling"
config CP_PERF_PROFILE
    bool "Log bounded CPU and operation timing samples"
    default n
    depends on FREERTOS_UNICORE && !FREERTOS_SMP
    depends on FREERTOS_GENERATE_RUN_TIME_STATS && FREERTOS_USE_TRACE_FACILITY
    depends on FREERTOS_RUN_TIME_STATS_USING_ESP_TIMER
    help
        Optional evaluation-only statistics, sampled by the existing supervisor
        every ten seconds. Requires explicit FreeRTOS run-time statistics with
        ESP_TIMER; prefer the U64 run-time counter for long observations.
        No new task or heap buffer. Scheduler-suspended lookups are measured.
        Six application-task stack high-water scans add measured suspended
        scheduler work; SDK task stacks are not scanned.
        Runtime statistics add per-task storage and context-switch overhead.
        Operation timings are overlapping wall time, not exclusive CPU time.
endmenu
